    "ALL_TEXT": "65 EXT. GOVARDHAN'S BUILDING-GATE - DAY \nANJI is sitting at ease, surrounded by a couple of \nconstables. He lights a cigarette, feeling relaxed. VEDA and \nGOVARDHAN arrive. GOVARDHAN gets off the bike and approaches \nVEDA. \nANJI \nVaadu oo yedava, vaadu oo loafer, \noka pancheyandi, vaadu dorikithey \nvaadini kalchipaareyendi, leda \nbokkalo eseyandi. Meeru emchesina \ngaani, vaadi figerprint naaku \ntechiyyandi, ee illu naa peruna \nrayinchukuntaanu...vaadi valla \nchaala suffer ayyaanu \nThe two constables finish up their report and leave. ANJI \nsees them off. GOVARDHAN, still burqha-clad, watches all of \nthis from the gate, perplexed. Out of nowhere, ANJI cat-calls \nGOVARDHAN. \nANJI \nAe miss, nee cut-top baaundi. Naaku \nnachindi. Ee inti owner raa daaniki \npadhi rojullu avuddi. Nuvvu \nkaavalante naa daggara vachi \nundachu. \nGOVARDHAN (V.O.) \nOrei Anji gaa, ee Burqha teyagaane \nneeku undi raa \nGOVARDHAN leaves, unhappy and furious. \nCUT TO:",
